Para. 1 let. 1 — [AS 1996 518; 1997 2779 Annex No II 5; 2002 886, 1759; 2006 1667, 5613 Art. 30 para. 2 No 1; 2009 6149 No I and II; 2010 3175 Annex 3 No 2; 2015 775; 2017 5161 Annex 2 No II 3]
Para. 1 let. 2 — [AS 2002 2663, 2006 4777, 2007 4519]
Para. 2 — The amendment may be consulted under AS 2020 691.
|

:INFO
Art. 32 Commencement
This Ordinance comes into force on 1 January 2021.

